WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.340
- [Narrator] In Sri Lanka,
fire dancing reigns supreme.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:08.580
Dozens of troupes spin
literal rings of fire.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.500
Lighting up parades and
celebrations all around the country.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:13.920
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.420
(upbeat music)

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.020
(lighthearted music)

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:31.900
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.260
- [Narrator] Sumedha is part
of a fire dancing troupe

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.060
of about 25 members
spread across the country.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.760
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.060
- [Narrator] Despite the danger,
Sumedha loves what he does.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:38.140
(speaks in foreign language)

